{"message":{"container":null,"content":[{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_01SsosZjqfi2RhgbtxzhCCea","input":{"final_source":"import Base\n\ndef negate(value: Bool) -> Bool:\n  Bool.not(value)\n\nlaw negate_matches_boolean_not:\n  for value: Bool\n  {negate(value) == Bool.not(value) : Bool}\n\ndef negate_matches_boolean_not(value):\n  {==}\n","language":"bend2","proof_explanation":"The negate function now correctly returns Bool.not(value), which directly implements total Boolean negation. The law negate_matches_boolean_not is satisfied trivially: since negate(value) definitionally reduces to Bool.not(value), the equality negate(value) == Bool.not(value) holds by reflexivity. The proof {==} establishes this reflexive equality.","schema":"semaprax.bend2-law-benchmark.boolean-edit-response.v1","seeded_attack":{"decision":"reject","reason":"The seeded attack fails to implement proper Boolean negation. It does not ensure negate(true) returns false and negate(false) returns true, violating the law negate_matches_boolean_not which requires negate(value) == Bool.not(value) for all Bool values.","source_sha256":"sha256:5ee075e4f37c305e1aa73ed7c81d7fa59815e58c5f4aeda4ac658e79c1fe96fa"},"trial_id":"boolean-negation-pair-v1:bend2:3"},"name":"StructuredOutput","type":"tool_use"}],"context_management":null,"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_011CfhnP9CVz9TT6crQQGCZn","input_transformations":[],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":1625,"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"request_id":"req_011CfhnP8rAA4JM4ddRb22eb","session_id":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-10-04T19:54:31.913Z","type":"assistant","uuid":"7874329e-cd31-4e7d-80e5-33057e1dd2b7","wire_tool_inputs":{"